                <pb facs="0506" n="394" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg394"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Hibben to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-05-10"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 10,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A manifest issued by the President of Colombia this evening referring to
                    Holguin’s action of March 13 (see telegram of the legation of the 14th March),
                    postpones consideration of the treaties until ordinary session of Congress next
                    February.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hibben.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
